OL,3,GNEWSAEnergy price increase 'could put  
OL,4,Ame in hospital'                        
OL,6,FKathleen Simms, from Stockton, said:   
OL,7,F"If I can't have the heating on, I'm   
OL,8,Fgoing to end up in hospital."          
